{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47230","headline":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 五 · 吴越僧","name":"武肃王有旨石桥设斋会进士一诗共六首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幡花宝盖满青川，祈祷迎来圣半千。\n莫道胜缘无影响，须知嘉会有因缘。\n空中长似闻天乐，岩畔常疑有地仙。\n何必更寻兜率去，重重灵应事昭然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴越僧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}